# Primeval Spawn's own line (ValidCard$ Card.Self+!wasCast,...): a Spawn that
# was not cast is exiled instead of entering. The line is read off the card
# itself as it would be on the battlefield (getReplacementList's affectedLKI),
# though it is in a graveyard now.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 3 B
tapformana human 4 B
tapformana human 5 B
tapformana human 6 B
queue paygeneric B
queue paygeneric B
queue paygeneric B
queue targets 7
castspell human 1
resolvestack
